sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as API Client
    participant Edge as Orders API<br/>Supabase Edge Function
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>Row Level Security

    User->>Edge: POST /orders<br/>apikey + Bearer access token
    Edge->>Auth: Validate access token
    Auth-->>Edge: Authenticated user identity
    Edge->>DB: INSERT order for authenticated user
    Note over DB: Row Level Security checks ownership policy
    DB-->>Edge: Created order
    Edge-->>User: 201 Created + JSON response

    Note over User,DB: Conceptual sequence derived from the published API contract and project description.
